=== Housing ===
The enactment of a [[property tax|cadastral tax]] ({{langx|pl|podatek katastralny}}) on owners of several properties was seen as a way to remedy the increasing cost of housing within cities. A SW Research poll showed that, overall, 40% of respondents supported and 34% opposed the introduction of a cadastral tax.<ref>{{cite news |date={{date|2025-04-06|DMY}} |title=Sondaż: Przeciwko wprowadzeniu podatku katastralnego jest co trzeci Polak |url=https://www.rp.pl/polityka/art42074161-sondaz-przeciwko-wprowadzeniu-podatku-katastralnego-jest-co-trzeci-polak |archive-url=https://archive.today/20250406063836/https://www.rp.pl/polityka/art42074161-sondaz-przeciwko-wprowadzeniu-podatku-katastralnego-jest-co-trzeci-polak |archive-date=2025-04-06 |access-date=2025-07-14}}</ref> Another proposed solution was the construction of low-rent housing by the state.

Nawrocki's stance on the cadastral tax idea was criticized as contradictory, with him stating opposition to a cadastral tax, yet supporting taxation of properties possessed by owners of three or more houses.<ref>{{cite web |date={{date|2025-04-29|DMY}} |last=Krześniak-Sajewicz |first=Monika |title=Nawrocki zmienia zdanie w sprawie podatku katastralnego? "Te wypowiedzi są sprzeczne" |url=https://biznes.interia.pl/nieruchomosci/news-nawrocki-zmienia-zdanie-w-sprawie-podatku-katastralnego-te-w,nId,7957049 |website=Interia |language=pl |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250429130951/https://biznes.interia.pl/nieruchomosci/news-nawrocki-zmienia-zdanie-w-sprawie-podatku-katastralnego-te-w,nId,7957049 |archive-date=29 April 2025 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |date={{date|2025-05-28|DMY}} |last=Ambroziak |first=Anton |title=Nawrocki i podatek katastralny: nie, tak, to zależy, zastanówmy się |url=https://oko.press/nawrocki-i-podatek-katastralny-nie-tak-to-zalezy-zastanowmy-sie |access-date=2025-07-12}}</ref> He promised to lower the cost of housing in the country, stating he would "fight for cheap housing".<ref>{{cite news |date={{date|2025-05-25|DMY}} |title="Będę bił się o więcej tanich mieszkań". Nawrocki apeluje do młodzieży |url=https://polskieradio24.pl/artykul/3528396,bede-bil-sie-o-wiecej-tanich-mieszkan-nawrocki-apeluje-do-mlodziezy |access-date=2025-07-22}}</ref>

Trzaskowski's electoral committee declared its candidate was against the introduction of a cadastral tax and in favor of state construction of housing.<ref name=lw>{{cite web |title=Latarnik Wyborczy |url=https://latarnikwyborczy.pl/wynik/#comment_22_51 |access-date=2025-07-14}}</ref> <!-- better source needed -->

Mentzen opposed cadastral taxes and was against state construction of low-rent housing.<ref name=mentzenprogram/>

=== Social issues ===
