On {{date|2025-04-11|DMY}}, two debates took place in [[Końskie]], widely described as chaotic.<ref name="Fijołek2025">{{Cite news |title=Przedziwny wieczór w Końskich. Od 30 lat czegoś takiego nie widzieli |last1=Fijołek |first1=Marcin |date={{date|2025-04-12|DMY}} |url=https://wydarzenia.interia.pl/wybory/prezydenckie/news-przedziwny-wieczor-w-konskich-od-30-lat-czegos-takiego-nie-w,nId,21395322 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250414203116/https://wydarzenia.interia.pl/wybory/prezydenckie/news-przedziwny-wieczor-w-konskich-od-30-lat-czegos-takiego-nie-w,nId,21395322 |archive-date={{date|2025-04-14|DMY}} |access-date={{date|2025-04-14|DMY}} |work=[[Interia]] |trans-title=A bizarre evening in Końskie. They haven't seen anything like it for 30 years |language=pl}}</ref><ref name="Sitnicka2025">{{Cite news |title=Debata TV Republiki wśród krzyków {{mdash}} publiczności, prowadzących, kandydatów |last1=Sitnicka |first1=Dominika |date={{date|2025-04-11|DMY}} |url=https://oko.press/debata-tv-republiki-wsrod-krzykow-publicznosci-prowadzacych-kandydatow |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250414202349/https://oko.press/debata-tv-republiki-wsrod-krzykow-publicznosci-prowadzacych-kandydatow |archive-date={{date|2025-04-14|DMY}} |access-date={{date|2025-04-14|DMY}} |work=[[OKO.press]] |trans-title=TV Republika debate amidst shouting {{mdash}} of audience, presenters, candidates |language=pl}}</ref><ref name="Sawka2025">{{Cite news |title=TVP i show w Końskich. Czy debata to kampania Trzaskowskiego za publiczne pieniądze? |last1=Sawka |first1=Natalia |date={{date|2025-04-11|DMY}} |url=https://oko.press/tvp-i-show-w-konskich-czy-debata-to-kampania-trzaskowskiego-za-publiczne-pieniadze |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250414202206/https://oko.press/tvp-i-show-w-konskich-czy-debata-to-kampania-trzaskowskiego-za-publiczne-pieniadze |archive-date={{date|2025-04-14|DMY}} |access-date={{date|2025-04-14|DMY}} |work=[[OKO.press]] |trans-title=TVP and the show in Końskie. Is the debate Trzaskowski's campaign for public money? |language=pl}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Dwie debaty w Końskich: Chaos, przepychanki, tęczowa flaga [ZAPIS RELACJI] |url=https://www.rmf24.pl/raporty/raport-wybory-prezydenckie-2025/news-dwie-debaty-w-konskich-chaos-przepychanki-teczowa-flaga-zapi,nId,7948107 |access-date=2025-04-13 |website=RMF24 |language=pl}}</ref> One was organized by TV Republika, {{ill|wPolsce24|pl}} and the Catholic [[Telewizja Trwam]], with five candidates participating (Hołownia, Jakubiak, Nawrocki, Senyszyn, Stanowski).<ref name="Sitnicka2025" /> Another one, organized by Trzaskowski's committee and moderated by journalists of TVP, TVN and Polsat, was held at the town's sports hall once the candidates from the earlier debate joined Biejat, Maciak and Trzaskowski.<ref name="Fijołek2025" /> The former was initiated in opposition to the latter event,<ref>{{Cite web |date=2025-04-11 |title=Zamieszanie wokół debaty Trzaskowski-Nawrocki. Republika wychodzi z kontrą |url=https://wiadomosci.onet.pl/kraj/zamieszanie-wokol-debaty-trzaskowski-nawrocki-republika-wychodzi-z-kontra/xbzvdnk |access-date=2025-04-13 |website=Onet Wiadomości |language=pl}}</ref> which organization started spontaneously on 9 April,<ref name="Sawka2025" /> and which in the beginning was meant for just the two leading candidates, however other ones were also invited just shortly before its planned start.<ref name="Fijołek2025" /> An IBRiS poll showed most respondents showing Trzaskowski (32.4%) as the winner of the debate, ahead of Nawrocki (28.0%), Hołownia (11.8%) and Biejat (10.6%). However, [[Marcin Duma]], the chairman of IBRiS, commented that relative to their standings in voting intention polls, Hołownia and Biejat were the clear winners of the debate.<ref name="IBRiS">{{cite |date={{date|2025-04-14|DMY}} |title=Debata prezydencka w Końskich: kto wygrał, kto oglądał, jak oceniono bojkot? |url=https://ibris.pl/debata-w-konskich/ |publisher=[[IBRiS]] |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260209174636/https://ibris.pl/debata-w-konskich/ |archive-date=2026-02-09 |access-date=2026-02-09}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |date={{date|2025-04-13|DMY}} |title=Kto wygrał debatę w Końskich? Polacy zdecydowali. Sondaż |url=https://www.pap.pl/aktualnosci/kto-wygral-debate-w-konskich-polacy-zdecydowali-sondaz |publisher=[[Polish Press Agency]] |access-date=2026-02-09}}</ref>

On {{date|2025-05-12|DMY}} an official presidential debate involving all 13 candidates was hosted by the state broadcaster [[Telewizja Polska]]. During the debate, two questions were published by an employee of the broadcaster Jarosław Olechowski on [[Twitter]] prior to being asked by the host {{ill|Dorota Wysocka-Schnepf|pl}}; one at the time of their publication, the other over an hour later.<ref>{{Cite web |date=2025-05-12 |title=Debata prezydencka w TVP. Wyciekły pytania Doroty Wysockiej-Schnepf |url=https://wiadomosci.gazeta.pl/wiadomosci/7,143907,31929143,wpadka-tvp-byly-pracownik-ujawnil-pytania-kilka-minut-pozniej.html |access-date=2025-05-13 |website=[[Gazeta.pl]] |last=Alberczyk |first=Izabela |language=pl}}</ref>

On {{date|2025-05-23|DMY}}, the first second-round debate was held between Nawrocki and Trzaskowski. The debate had thematic sections for healthcare, foreign policy, economics, welfare, security and social policy.<ref>{{cite news |date={{date|2025-05-23|DMY}} |title= Debata prezydencka. Jakie tematy pojawią się podczas spotkania Rafała Trzaskowskiego i Karola Nawrockiego?  |url=https://www.gazetaprawna.pl/wiadomosci/kraj/artykuly/9806724,debata-prezydencka-te-tematy-pojawia-sie-podczas-spotkania-rafala-trzaskowskiego-i-karola-nawrockiego.html |access-date={{date|2025-05-27|DMY}}}}</ref> Nawrocki was criticized for using a nicotine pouch ([[snus]]) in the middle of the debate.<ref>{{cite news |date={{date|2025-05-24|DMY}} |last=Dmitruczuk |first=Anita |title=Snus przebił się na debacie prezydenckiej. Czym jest używka Karola Nawrockiego? |url=https://www.gazetaprawna.pl/wiadomosci/kraj/artykuly/9807189,snus-przebil-sie-na-debacie-prezydenckiej-czym-jest-uzywka-karola-naw.html |access-date={{date|2025-05-27|DMY}}}}</ref> Meanwhile, Trzaskowski caused controversy for calling {{ill|Stowarzyszenie Demagog|pl}} to fact-check Nawrocki, which confirmed Nawrocki's statement.<ref>{{cite news |date={{date|2025-05-23|DMY}} |title=Co za cios w Trzaskowskiego! Wezwał serwis "Demagog" do sprawdzenia słów Nawrockiego. Okazały się... prawdziwe! |url=https://wpolityce.pl/polityka/730384-co-za-cios-w-trzaskowskiego-pograzyl-go-serwis-demagog |access-date={{date|2025-05-27|DMY}}}}</ref>

The final debate of the election, organized by [[Telewizja Republika]], was set to take place on {{date|2025-05-28|DMY}} in the market square of [[Końskie]]. However, Trzaskowski ultimately declined the invitation and instead travelled to [[Kalisz]] to speak with voters in a one-on-one format there. Nawrocki's televised conversation with the town's residents was interrupted by [[Witold Zembaczyński]], who drew attention to himself using a deck of cards and by running in front of the stage.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Prusinowski |first1=Jacek |title=Zembaczyński appeared in Końskie. An incident instead of a debate on TV Republika |url=https://www.wprost.pl/kraj/12028396/zembaczynski-na-debacie-tv-republika-incydent-w-konskich.html |access-date=3 June 2025 |publisher=Wprost |date=28 May 2025}}</ref>

Journalist [[Krzysztof Stanowski (journalist)|Krzysztof Stanowski]], himself a candidate, held extensive interviews with all of the other candidates,<ref>{{cite news |title=Zaskakująca rola Stanowskiego w kampanii. "Robi dobrą robotę" |url=https://www.tokfm.pl/Tokfm/7,103087,31833250,zaskakujaca-rola-stanowskiego-w-kampanii-robi-dobra-robote.html |access-date=2025-04-09}}</ref> except for [[Maciej Maciak]], the interview with whom was ended abruptly just after a few minutes once Maciak expressed favorable views about the Russian president [[Vladimir Putin]].<ref>{{cite web |title=Ekspresowy wywiad Stanowskiego z Maciakiem. Po słowach o Putinie dziennikarz opuścił studio |url=https://wiadomosci.gazeta.pl/wiadomosci/7,114884,31900606,ekspresowy-wywiad-stanowskiego-z-maciakiem-po-slowach-o-putinie.html |website=Gazeta.pl |date=2025-04-30 |access-date=2025-05-02}}</ref> Stanowski's interviews had a major influence on the course of the electoral campaign.<ref>{{cite news |date={{date|2025-05-30|DMY}} |title=Michał Kolanko: Kampania wyborcza 2025 przyniosła medialną rewolucję |url=https://www.rp.pl/publicystyka/art42413461-michal-kolanko-kampania-wyborcza-2025-przyniosla-medialna-rewolucje |access-date=2025-07-09}}</ref>
